      "id": "claim_d024f931f0ac4af68484ffab3e10074c",
      "statement": "Spring Boot lets you externalize your configuration so that you can work with the same application code in different environments. You can use a variety of external configuration sources including Java properties files, YAML files, environment variables, and command-line arguments.",
      "evidence": [
